'''''Erica platycodon''''' is a plant belonging to the genus ''[[Erica (plant)|Erica]]''.<ref>http://plantsoftheworldonline.org/taxon/urn:lsid:ipni.org:names:971786-1 Plants of the World Online</ref> The plant is endemic to the [[Canary Islands]] and [[Madeira]].<ref>https://www.arbolappcanarias.es/en/species/info/erica-platycodon/</ref>

It also has a subspecies: ''Erica platycodon'' subsp. ''maderincola''.<ref>(D.C.McClint.) Rivas Mart. & al.</ref>

